Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 06:35:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] wordpad: /p prints the document on the default printer (9761)

wordpad.exe /p is the print verb of .rtf and .wri files (File Explorer's
Print, ShellExecute "print"); Windows' WordPad prints the document on the
default printer and closes. Wine's said "Printing not implemented." and
printed nothing. It now prints with print_quick() (the toolbar's Print) and
closes.
Gate test/wordpadprint-gate.sh; mutant SG_MUTANT_WORDPAD_NO_PRINT.
---
--- a/programs/wordpad/wordpad.c
+++ b/programs/wordpad/wordpad.c
@@ -1234,8 +1234,17 @@
         InvalidateRect(hMainWnd, NULL, FALSE);
     }
 
+    /* /p: print the document on the default printer and close, as Windows' WordPad (the
+       print verb of .rtf and .wri files is wordpad.exe /p "%1") */
     if (opt_print)
+    {
+#ifndef SG_MUTANT_WORDPAD_NO_PRINT
+        if (*cmdline) print_quick(hMainWnd, wszFileName);
+        DestroyWindow(hMainWnd);
+#else
         MessageBoxWithResStringW(hMainWnd, MAKEINTRESOURCEW(STRING_PRINTING_NOT_IMPLEMENTED), L"WordPad", MB_OK);
+#endif
+    }
 }
 
 static LRESULT handle_findmsg(LPFINDREPLACEW pFr)
